  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to undertake essential maintenance and upgrades of the school&#x2019;s guesthouse, hall and cooking facilities. The first two improvements will enhance income generation through the provision of improved accommodation and hall rental services to visiting like-minded NGOs and INGOs, and the latter will improve the cooking conditions by promoting clean cooking and energy efficient institutional stoves.</narrative>
